# CRITICAL EXCEPTION, discovered and fixed during independent-review
# response: the blanket *.log rule above was silently excluding real
# execution-log evidence directories from every commit, even though
# they were repeatedly described as "attached" - a fresh clone via
# git alone (not the packaged .zip) would have been missing them
# entirely. These specific directories are real deliverable evidence,
# not disposable log noise:
!run-logs/
!run-logs/**
!run-logs-languages/
!run-logs-languages/**
!run-logs-regression-post-doc-fix/
!run-logs-regression-post-doc-fix/**
!run-logs-js-bridge-module-resolution-fix/
!run-logs-js-bridge-module-resolution-fix/**
.DS_Store

